# Cache version

When `app.js`, `index.html`, `styles.css`, `sw.js`, or `manifest.webmanifest` changes, set the same cache version in all of these:

- `app.js` data fetches and `sw.js?v=`
- `index.html` icon, stylesheet, and script
- `sw.js` `CACHE` name `magic-auction-vN` and each asset `?v=N`
- `manifest.webmanifest` icon

`app.js` at `?v=280` with `sw.js` at `magic-auction-v279` is a failed bump. Set every copy to the same number. `privacy.html` keeps `styles.css?v=141`. Do not pretty-print `data/treasures.json`.
